cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reproducibility materials, please cite this release and the associated article."
title: "PALM LULC–Water Quality Reproducibility Package"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Loaiza"
    given-names: "Juan Gabriel"
    affiliation: "Universidad Autónoma de Sinaloa (UAS), Mexico"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for the analysis of land-use/land-cover change and
  water-quality dynamics in the Adolfo López Mateos Reservoir (PALM), Sinaloa,
  Mexico. The package includes Google Earth Engine classification scripts,
  portable Python notebooks, analytical inputs, canonical derived products,
  selected outputs, and numerical validation records.
keywords:
  - land use land cover
  - water quality
  - Landsat 8
  - Google Earth Engine
  - Random Forest
  - remote sensing
  - reproducibility
